@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Process liveness (does not query PostgreSQL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Database readiness (503 when PostgreSQL is unavailable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
